      "options": {
        "content": "## DonMoa Control Room\nUse `$service` to focus on one service, then scroll down to inspect recent logs. `requestId` correlation lives in the **Request Trace** dashboard.\n\n- `edge-nginx` shows ingress/access logs\n- `client-gateway` is the primary entry service\n- Application logs are structured JSON as services roll forward",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.4.1",
      "title": "Overview",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
